    "notes": {
      "Prendel3/Moon 2": "layout() honours pins and validate() enforces them, but this pin is deliberately NOT declared: it is geometrically impossible under 20x body scaling. Prendel 3's planet is 360 GU in BC and becomes 7200 GU; Moon 2 becomes 1800 GU, so they need 9000 GU between centres. BC placed Moon 2 at set-local (400, 5000, 0) = 5016 GU from the region origin, so honouring the pin lands the moon inside its own planet and the body-overlap rule correctly rejects it. E5M2 and E6M4 stage a base and three Galors at 6100-6368 GU just past this moon; with no pin, that staging no longer sits beside it."
    }
